hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24262","Yazid ibn Harun narrated to us, Shu'bah narrated to us, from Simak ibn Harb, who said: I heard Abu Safwan Malik ibn Umayr al-Asadi, Muhammad ibn Ja'far said: Umayrah, say: I came to Makkah before the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) migrated, and a man bought trousers from me and gave me extra in weight."
